data: {"type": "message", "content": {"type": "ai", "content": "I can\u2019t run background tasks directly from this chat \u2014 I don\u2019t have access to your machine, shell, or scheduler, and I can\u2019t keep a process running after responding.\n\nIf you share what you want to run, I can help you set it up, for example:\n\n- Linux/macOS: `nohup ./task.sh > task.log 2>&1 &`\n- `systemd` service/timer\n- `cron` job\n- Windows Task Scheduler\n- CI/CD scheduled workflow\n- Python: `subprocess`, `schedule`, `APScheduler`, Celery, etc.\n\nWhat\u2019s the task or command you want to run?", "tool_calls": [], "tool_call_id": null, "status": null, "run_id": "01a1087e-69be-7d42-a469-f985ae855028", "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "model_name": "deepseek-flash", "system_fingerprint": "aeb56401ca74e127821c4f9126dcb669", "model_provider": "openai"}, "custom_data": {}}}

